SUMMARY:Indios Amigos Traveling Exhibit at Gulf Breeze and Pace Libraries
LOCATION:Gulf Breeze Library\, then Pace Library\, 1060 Shoreline Drive\, G
 ulf Breeze\, FL 32561
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 10/7 to Saturday 10/10 at Gulf Breeze · Monday 10/12
  to Saturday 10/17 at Pace\n\nGulf Breeze Library and then Pace Library ho
 st a bilingual traveling exhibit from the Florida Public Archaeology Netwo
 rk for Hispanic Heritage Month. It tells the story of the Aztec artisans a
 nd warriors who sailed with Tristan de Luna's 1559 expedition to Pensacola
 . The display stays up all week at each branch\, so it fits a quick stop o
 n a library visit.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coasta
 leventures.com/events/ev-indios-amigos-exhibit-gulf-breeze-pace-1007.html
