LOCATION:Navarre Beach Boat Launch Parking Lot\, Gulf Blvd\, Navarre\, FL 3
 2566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/17 · Packet pickup 7:00 AM · Run/walk starts 8:00
  AM\n\nNavarre Pink Pirates runs its 12th annual 5K run/walk along Navarre
  Beach to raise money for mammograms. The course heads west from the Boat 
 Launch lot and back. Active.com's registration lists $25 for run or walk\,
  $30 day-of\, and the organizer's own site confirms the October 17 date. T
