DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Talking to the Dead: The Victorian Seance
LOCATION:Historic Pensacola Village\, Barkley House\, 410 South Florida Bla
 nca Street\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · 6:30 PM\, 7:30 PM and 8:30 PM\n\nHistoric Pen
 sacola's living history staff stage a Victorian seance in the Barkley Hous
 e\, with the origins of All Hallow's Eve and the rise of spiritualism expl
 ained along the way. The group shows the stage tricks that were common in 
 a seance of that era. Each session is limited to 8 people\, and it is the 
