SUMMARY:Pensacola Winterfest
LOCATION:Plaza Wonderland\, Old County Courthouse\, 223 S Palafox Pl\, Pens
 acola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Fri 11/27 to Thu 12/24 · Fri to Sun evenings\, then daily from
  12/18\n\nPensacola Winterfest is a volunteer-run holiday event around the
  Old County Courthouse in downtown Pensacola\, with snow falling on Plaza 
 Wonderland and trolley tours themed on Peanuts\, The Polar Express and the
  Grinch\, plus a Scrooge and Marley tour in Christmas week. Each tour runs
  about 25 minutes. Snow and music in the plaza are free\, and photo sessio
 ns with Santa are booked by the group. Reservations are strongly recommend
 ed because recent seasons sold out in advance.\n\nPrice: from $17\n\nDetai
 ls: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-pensacola-winterfest-1127.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-pensacola-winterfest-1127.html
